      "notes": "3Sep\n-- I was not able to see the logs of deployement so i raised a oim entitlement OAL-ATG-READONLY. After the approval it worked\n-- While deploying i faced several challenges \nRaman created a Git Repo OALTerritoryQuantAIOjetUI.git for UI\nOALTerritoryQuantAIWS.git for Webservice\nunder UI repo I created an Integration branch\nI imported that branch to my local machine under \nDocument --> patching-->apex--OALTerritoryQuantAIOjetUI\nThen i downloaded Terra repo used it to put the both the folder in codex asked it push similar setup to the new repo based on Integration.\nthen i started facing deployment issues\ncheck this thread in codex desktop \"Create React activity tracker\"\nRaman gave another \"log from cloud\" to check errors in the deployment\nit shows all kubernatics/Docker related issues\nI passed below\nContainer = 'oal-quant-ai-ui' and Namespace = 'terr-at' | timestats count as logrecords by 'Log Source' | sort -logrecords\nand pressed Run it showed my the errors\nit has kubernatics container status logs/ kubernatics container generic logs/ in the graph you can select 1 of them and see the filter gets change you can also restict the period for which it shows the output.\nafter few tries finally it worked deployment gets successful.",
